-// Count-based thresholds for Punctuation monster stages (Tier 1).
-// Index 0 is unused by stageFor (the loop starts at stage 1).
-// [_, 1, 2, 4, 14] means: stage 1 at 1 mastered, stage 2 at 2, stage 3 at 4, stage 4 (Mega) at 14.
